// MISRA C:2012 deviations and third-party suppression patterns.
// Each entry records the rule, the reason, and the ADR that documents it.
// Add here, never silence by renaming files.

// cppcheck version-dependent style nits: const-pointer suggestions on cast
// sites inside the vtable fakes. The fake's ctx pointer is mutable (tests
// enqueue/advance state), and the vtable callbacks pass non-const self, so the
// suggestion is not actionable; enabling it would make CI depend on the exact
// cppcheck version instead of on real defects.
constVariablePointer
constParameterPointer

// Domain code that intentionally deviates; the specific deviation is logged
// next to the suppressed check in the source and in docs/adr/.
missingIncludeSystem
unknownMacro

// Vendor HAL and generated CubeMX code are not ours to police.
*:src/adapters/stm32f4/*
*:cubemx/*
